<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Pathkeeper | Opportunity Intelligence Center</title>

<style>

:root{
    --forest:#17372A;
    --forest2:#214C38;
    --forest3:#2E6349;
    --cream:#F7F1E3;
    --paper:#FFFDF7;
    --sage:#BFD8C5;
    --mint:#DDEBDF;
    --gold:#D7B56D;
    --brown:#634B35;
    --blue:#52738C;
    --red:#A85845;
    --ink:#17251E;
    --muted:#66756C;
    --line:#D8DED8;
    --shadow:0 14px 40px rgba(16,43,31,.12);
    --radius:18px;
}

*{
    margin:0;
    padding:0;
    box-sizing:border-box;
}

html{
    scroll-behavior:smooth;
}

body{
    font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI",sans-serif;
    background:var(--cream);
    color:var(--ink);
    line-height:1.7;
}

a{
    color:inherit;
}

.navbar{
    background:var(--forest);
    color:white;
    min-height:64px;
    padding:.8rem 4%;
    display:flex;
    justify-content:space-between;
    align-items:center;
    gap:20px;
    position:sticky;
    top:0;
    z-index:100;
}

.logo{
    font-size:1.1rem;
    font-weight:900;
    letter-spacing:.08em;
}

.nav-links{
    display:flex;
    flex-wrap:wrap;
    gap:18px;
}

.nav-links a{
    color:#F5F8F3;
    text-decoration:none;
    font-size:.84rem;
}

.nav-links a:hover{
    color:var(--gold);
}

.hero{
    background:
        radial-gradient(
            circle at 85% 20%,
            rgba(215,181,109,.17),
            transparent 25%
        ),
        linear-gradient(
            135deg,
            #17372A,
            #28533D
        );
    color:white;
    padding:4rem 5%;
}

.hero-inner{
    max-width:1250px;
    margin:auto;
}

.eyebrow{
    color:var(--gold);
    font-weight:900;
    letter-spacing:.13em;
    text-transform:uppercase;
    font-size:.7rem;
    margin-bottom:1rem;
}

.hero h1{
    max-width:950px;
    font-size:clamp(2.3rem,5vw,4.5rem);
    line-height:1.04;
    margin-bottom:1.3rem;
}

.hero > .hero-inner > p{
    max-width:850px;
    color:#E7EFE9;
    font-size:1.05rem;
}

/* HERO VALUE GRID */

.hero-grid{
    margin-top:2.8rem;
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);
    gap:1px;
    background:rgba(255,255,255,.16);
    border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.16);
    border-radius:18px;
    overflow:hidden;
}

.hero-stat{
    position:relative;
    min-height:225px;
    padding:1.6rem;
    background:rgba(255,255,255,.055);
    transition:
        background .3s ease,
        transform .3s ease;
}

.hero-stat:hover{
    background:rgba(255,255,255,.11);
    transform:translateY(-5px);
}

.hero-stat-label{
    display:inline-block;
    margin-bottom:2.4rem;
    color:var(--gold);
    font-size:.63rem;
    font-weight:900;
    letter-spacing:.14em;
}

.hero-stat strong{
    display:block;
    color:white;
    font-size:1.25rem;
    line-height:1.2;
    margin-bottom:.7rem;
}

.hero-stat p{
    color:#DCE8DF;
    font-size:.8rem;
    line-height:1.55;
    margin:0;
}

.hero-stat:nth-child(1)::before{
    content:"01";
}

.hero-stat:nth-child(2)::before{
    content:"02";
}

.hero-stat:nth-child(3)::before{
    content:"03";
}

.hero-stat:nth-child(4)::before{
    content:"04";
}

.hero-stat::before{
    position:absolute;
    right:14px;
    top:10px;
    font-size:3.5rem;
    line-height:1;
    font-weight:900;
    color:rgba(255,255,255,.045);
}

.container{
    width:min(1250px,92%);
    margin:auto;
}

section{
    padding:4rem 0;
}

.section-heading{
    display:flex;
    justify-content:space-between;
    align-items:end;
    gap:20px;
    margin-bottom:2rem;
}

.section-heading h2{
    color:var(--forest);
    font-size:clamp(1.7rem,3vw,2.5rem);
    line-height:1.15;
}

.section-heading p{
    max-width:650px;
    color:var(--muted);
}

/* LESSON */

.lesson{
    background:var(--paper);
    border:1px solid var(--line);
    border-left:6px solid var(--forest3);
    padding:1.7rem;
    border-radius:0 var(--radius) var(--radius) 0;
    margin-bottom:2rem;
    box-shadow:var(--shadow);
}

.lesson-label{
    color:var(--forest3);
    text-transform:uppercase;
    letter-spacing:.1em;
    font-size:.7rem;
    font-weight:900;
    margin-bottom:.5rem;
}

.lesson h2,
.lesson h3{
    color:var(--forest);
    margin-bottom:1rem;
}

/* VALUE GRID */

.value-grid{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);
    gap:1px;
    background:#B9C4BB;
    border:1px solid #B9C4BB;
    border-radius:22px;
    overflow:hidden;
    box-shadow:0 20px 55px rgba(16,43,31,.13);
}

.value-card{
    min-height:470px;
    padding:1.8rem;
    position:relative;
    display:flex;
    flex-direction:column;
    background:#FFFDF7;
    overflow:hidden;
    transition:
        transform .3s ease,
        background .3s ease;
}

.value-card:hover{
    background:#F4F7F1;
    transform:translateY(-7px);
    z-index:5;
}

.value-card:before{
    content:"";
    position:absolute;
    right:-20px;
    top:35px;
    font-size:8rem;
    line-height:1;
    font-weight:900;
    color:rgba(23,55,42,.045);
    pointer-events:none;
}

.value-education:before{
    content:"01";
}

.value-learning:before{
    content:"02";
}

.value-career:before{
    content:"03";
}

.value-business:before{
    content:"04";
}

.value-top{
    position:relative;
    z-index:2;
    display:flex;
    justify-content:space-between;
    align-items:center;
    margin-bottom:3rem;
    font-size:.63rem;
    font-weight:900;
    letter-spacing:.1em;
    color:#617066;
}

.value-top span:first-child{
    font-size:1.4rem;
    color:var(--forest);
}

.value-card h3{
    position:relative;
    z-index:2;
    color:var(--forest);
    font-size:1.55rem;
    line-height:1.12;
    margin-bottom:1rem;
    max-width:220px;
}

.value-card p{
    position:relative;
    z-index:2;
    color:#5D6A62;
    font-size:.88rem;
    line-height:1.65;
}

.value-insight{
    position:relative;
    z-index:2;
    margin-top:1.5rem;
    padding-top:1rem;
    border-top:1px solid #D8DED8;
    display:flex;
    flex-wrap:wrap;
    gap:.45rem;
}

.value-insight strong{
    width:100%;
    color:var(--forest);
    font-size:.7rem;
    text-transform:uppercase;
    letter-spacing:.08em;
    margin-bottom:.25rem;
}

.value-insight span{
    background:#EEF3EE;
    color:#345242;
    border-radius:5px;
    padding:.35rem .55rem;
    font-size:.68rem;
    font-weight:700;
}

.value-bottom{
    position:relative;
    z-index:2;
    margin-top:auto;
    padding-top:1.3rem;
    color:#6A756D;
    font-size:.72rem;
    border-top:1px solid #D8DED8;
}

.value-bottom strong{
    color:var(--forest);
}

.value-education{
    border-top:7px solid #315C46;
}

.value-learning{
    border-top:7px solid #52738C;
}

.value-career{
    border-top:7px solid #D7B56D;
}

.value-business{
    border-top:7px solid #634B35;
}

/* MATRIX */

.matrix-wrap{
    overflow-x:auto;
    background:var(--paper);
    border-radius:var(--radius);
    box-shadow:var(--shadow);
}

.matrix{
    width:100%;
    min-width:850px;
    border-collapse:collapse;
}

.matrix th{
    background:var(--forest);
    color:white;
    padding:1rem;
    text-align:left;
}

.matrix td{
    padding:1rem;
    border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);
    vertical-align:top;
}

.score{
    display:inline-block;
    padding:.2rem .55rem;
    border-radius:999px;
    font-size:.7rem;
    font-weight:800;
}

.high{
    background:#DCECDD;
    color:#235533;
}

.medium{
    background:#F2E5BF;
    color:#72551B;
}

.low{
    background:#F1D9D2;
    color:#77372B;
}

/* TWO COLUMN */

.two-column{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;
    gap:1.5rem;
}

/* CHART */

.chart{
    background:var(--paper);
    padding:2rem;
    border:1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius:var(--radius);
    box-shadow:var(--shadow);
}

.chart-title{
    font-weight:900;
    color:var(--forest);
    margin-bottom:1.5rem;
}

.bar-row{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:150px 1fr 50px;
    align-items:center;
    gap:12px;
    margin:1rem 0;
}

.bar-label{
    font-size:.84rem;
    font-weight:700;
}

.bar-track{
    height:15px;
    background:#E3E8E3;
    border-radius:20px;
    overflow:hidden;
}

.bar{
    height:100%;
    border-radius:20px;
    background:var(--forest3);
}

.bar.gold{
    background:var(--gold);
}

.bar.blue{
    background:var(--blue);
}

.bar.brown{
    background:var(--brown);
}

.bar.red{
    background:var(--red);
}

.bar-value{
    font-size:.8rem;
    font-weight:900;
}

/* RESOURCE PANELS */

.resource-panel{
    background:var(--paper);
    border:1px solid var(--line);
    padding:1.5rem;
    border-radius:var(--radius);
    height:100%;
}

.resource-panel h3{
    color:var(--forest);
    margin-bottom:1rem;
}

.resource-panel ul{
    list-style:none;
}

.resource-panel li{
    padding:.7rem 0;
    border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);
    position:relative;
    padding-left:1.4rem;
}

.resource-panel li:last-child{
    border-bottom:0;
}

.resource-panel li:before{
    content:"→";
    position:absolute;
    left:0;
    color:var(--forest3);
    font-weight:900;
}

/* SYSTEM */

.system{
    background:var(--forest);
    color:white;
    padding:2rem;
    border-radius:var(--radius);
}

.system h3{
    color:var(--gold);
    margin-bottom:1.5rem;
}

.system-flow{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:1fr auto 1fr auto 1fr auto 1fr auto 1fr;
    gap:10px;
    align-items:center;
}

.node{
    background:rgba(255,255,255,.08);
    border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.13);
    padding:1rem;
    text-align:center;
    border-radius:12px;
    font-size:.82rem;
}

.arrow{
    color:var(--gold);
    font-size:1.3rem;
}

/* PATHWAYS */

.pathway-section{
    padding:4rem 0;
    border-top:1px solid var(--line);
}

.pathway-header{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:130px 1fr;
    gap:2rem;
    margin-bottom:2rem;
}

.pathway-number{
    font-size:4rem;
    font-weight:900;
    color:var(--sage);
    line-height:1;
}

.pathway-header h2{
    color:var(--forest);
    font-size:2rem;
}

.pathway-header p{
    color:var(--muted);
    max-width:800px;
}

/* RESOURCE CARDS */

.resource-cards{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);
    gap:1rem;
}

.resource-card{
    background:white;
    padding:1.4rem;
    border:1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius:14px;
}

.resource-card:nth-child(3n+1){
    border-top:4px solid var(--forest3);
}

.resource-card:nth-child(3n+2){
    border-top:4px solid var(--gold);
}

.resource-card:nth-child(3n+3){
    border-top:4px solid var(--blue);
}

.resource-card h4{
    color:var(--forest);
    margin-bottom:.5rem;
}

.resource-card p{
    color:var(--muted);
    font-size:.88rem;
}

/* DECISIONS */

.decision{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);
    gap:1rem;
}

.decision-card{
    padding:1.5rem;
    border-radius:14px;
    background:var(--mint);
}

.decision-card:nth-child(2){
    background:#F3E8CD;
}

.decision-card:nth-child(3){
    background:#E1E8ED;
}

.decision-card strong{
    display:block;
    color:var(--forest);
    margin-bottom:.5rem;
}

/* EXPERIMENTS */

.experiment{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);
    gap:1rem;
}

.experiment-card{
    background:var(--forest);
    color:white;
    padding:1.4rem;
    border-radius:14px;
}

.experiment-card small{
    color:var(--gold);
    font-weight:800;
}

.experiment-card h4{
    margin:.5rem 0;
}

/* CHECKLIST */

.checklist{
    background:white;
    padding:1.5rem;
    border-radius:var(--radius);
    border:1px solid var(--line);
}

.check{
    display:flex;
    gap:12px;
    padding:.75rem 0;
    border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);
}

.check:last-child{
    border-bottom:0;
}

.checkbox{
    width:22px;
    height:22px;
    border:2px solid var(--forest3);
    border-radius:5px;
    flex-shrink:0;
}

/* RESOURCE INDEX */

.index{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);
    gap:1rem;
}

.index-card{
    background:var(--forest);
    color:white;
    padding:1.5rem;
    border-radius:14px;
}

.index-card h3{
    color:var(--gold);
    margin-bottom:.5rem;
}

.index-card a{
    display:block;
    color:#E8F0E9;
    text-decoration:none;
    font-size:.85rem;
    margin:.45rem 0;
}

.index-card a:hover{
    color:var(--gold);
}

/* FOOTER */

footer{
    background:#10291F;
    color:#DDE8DF;
    padding:3rem 5%;
    text-align:center;
}

footer strong{
    color:var(--gold);
}

/* RESPONSIVE */

@media(max-width:1050px){

    .value-grid{
        grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);
    }

    .hero-grid{
        grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);
    }

    .resource-cards{
        grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);
    }

    .index{
        grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);
    }

    .experiment{
        grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);
    }

    .system-flow{
        grid-template-columns:1fr;
    }

    .arrow{
        transform:rotate(90deg);
        text-align:center;
    }
}

@media(max-width:700px){

    .navbar{
        flex-direction:column;
        align-items:flex-start;
    }

    .nav-links{
        gap:10px;
    }

    .hero{
        padding-top:3rem;
    }

    .hero-grid{
        grid-template-columns:1fr;
    }

    .hero-stat{
        min-height:auto;
    }

    .hero-stat-label{
        margin-bottom:1rem;
    }

    .value-grid{
        grid-template-columns:1fr;
    }

    .two-column,
    .resource-cards,
    .decision,
    .experiment,
    .index{
        grid-template-columns:1fr;
    }

    .pathway-header{
        grid-template-columns:1fr;
        gap:.5rem;
    }

    .pathway-number{
        font-size:3rem;
    }

    .bar-row{
        grid-template-columns:100px 1fr 35px;
    }
}

@media(max-width:450px){

    .hero h1{
        font-size:2.3rem;
    }

    section{
        padding:3rem 0;
    }
}

</style>
</head>

<body>

<nav class="navbar">

<div class="logo">
🌿 PATHKEEPER
</div>

<div class="nav-links">
<a href="#overview">Overview</a>
<a href="#education">Education</a>
<a href="#selfeducation">Self-Education</a>
<a href="#career">Career</a>
<a href="#business">Business</a>
<a href="#resources">Resources</a>
</div>

</nav>


<header class="hero">

<div class="hero-inner">

<div class="eyebrow">
Opportunity Intelligence System
</div>

<h1>
Don't Just Find Opportunities.
Learn How to Engineer Access to Them.
</h1>

<p>
An opportunity is rarely just a link to an application.
The real advantage comes from understanding the system behind
the opportunity: eligibility, timing, evidence, relationships,
skills, competition, funding, and what becomes possible next.
</p>


<div class="hero-grid">

<div class="hero-stat">

<span class="hero-stat-label">
ACCESS
</span>

<strong>
Find Hidden Doors
</strong>

<p>
Scholarships, fellowships, apprenticeships,
employer programs, grants, and institutional resources.
</p>

</div>


<div class="hero-stat">

<span class="hero-stat-label">
EVIDENCE
</span>

<strong>
Build Proof
</strong>

<p>
Projects, case studies, portfolios, results,
references, and documented accomplishments.
</p>

</div>


<div class="hero-stat">

<span class="hero-stat-label">
POSITIONING
</span>

<strong>
Become Easier to Choose
</strong>

<p>
Translate your skills and experience into evidence
that employers, schools, and customers can understand.
</p>

</div>


<div class="hero-stat">

<span class="hero-stat-label">
LEVERAGE
</span>

<strong>
Make One Action Create Another
</strong>

<p>
Turn learning into proof, proof into relationships,
and relationships into opportunities.
</p>

</div>

</div>

</div>

</header>


<main class="container" id="overview">


<section>

<div class="lesson">

<div class="lesson-label">
Higher-Level Lesson
</div>

<h3>
Opportunity is a system, not an event.
</h3>

<p>
Many people search for opportunities by asking:
<strong>"What is available to me?"</strong>
</p>

<br>

<p>
A stronger question is:
<strong>
"What sequence of actions would increase the number and quality
of opportunities available to me six months from now?"
</strong>
</p>

<br>

<p>
A scholarship can reduce education costs.
A project can create evidence.
A mentor can provide information.
A temporary position can create industry experience.
A case study can create credibility.
A customer can create revenue and a referral.
</p>

<br>

<p>
The objective is therefore not simply to collect opportunities.
The objective is to create an
<strong>opportunity pipeline.</strong>
</p>

</div>


<div class="section-heading">

<div>

<h2>
What Each Pathway Can Actually Give You
</h2>

</div>

<p>
The pathway is only the vehicle. The real value is the asset
you accumulate and carry into your next opportunity.
</p>

</div>


<div class="value-grid">


<article class="value-card value-education">

<div class="value-top">
<span>01</span>
<span>ASSET: ACCESS</span>
</div>

<h3>
Education Can Buy You Access
</h3>

<p>
Education is valuable beyond the credential. The right program
can place you closer to people, information, employers,
research, equipment, and opportunities that are difficult
to reach independently.
</p>

<div class="value-insight">

<strong>Look for:</strong>

<span>Faculty relationships</span>
<span>Department funding</span>
<span>Research opportunities</span>
<span>Alumni networks</span>
<span>Employer partnerships</span>

</div>

<div class="value-bottom">
The hidden advantage →
<strong>proximity</strong>
</div>

</article>


<article class="value-card value-learning">

<div class="value-top">
<span>02</span>
<span>ASSET: CAPABILITY</span>
</div>

<h3>
Self-Education Can Create Capability
</h3>

<p>
You do not have to wait for permission to develop a skill.
The advantage of self-education is the ability to target a
specific capability and immediately turn learning into evidence.
</p>

<div class="value-insight">

<strong>Turn learning into:</strong>

<span>Projects</span>
<span>Case studies</span>
<span>Demonstrations</span>
<span>Portfolios</span>
<span>Problem-solving evidence</span>

</div>

<div class="value-bottom">
The hidden advantage →
<strong>speed</strong>
</div>

</article>


<article class="value-card value-career">

<div class="value-top">
<span>03</span>
<span>ASSET: PROOF</span>
</div>

<h3>
Your Job Can Become Career Capital
</h3>

<p>
A job is not only a paycheck. Every responsibility can produce
evidence of reliability, judgment, communication, leadership,
problem-solving, or operational ability.
</p>

<div class="value-insight">

<strong>Document:</strong>

<span>Problems solved</span>
<span>Processes improved</span>
<span>Customers helped</span>
<span>Errors prevented</span>
<span>Responsibilities earned</span>

</div>

<div class="value-bottom">
The hidden advantage →
<strong>evidence</strong>
</div>

</article>


<article class="value-card value-business">

<div class="value-top">
<span>04</span>
<span>ASSET: MARKET PROOF</span>
</div>

<h3>
Business Can Create Market Evidence
</h3>

<p>
A customer is more than revenue. A successful transaction can
demonstrate that you identified a problem, created a solution,
communicated value, and convinced someone to act.
</p>

<div class="value-insight">

<strong>Build:</strong>

<span>Customer feedback</span>
<span>Testimonials</span>
<span>Sales evidence</span>
<span>Partnerships</span>
<span>Repeat business</span>

</div>

<div class="value-bottom">
The hidden advantage →
<strong>validation</strong>
</div>

</article>

</div>

</section>


<section>

