<div class="lesson">

<div class="lesson-label">
Analysis
</div>

<h3>
Why the final two levels matter.
</h3>

<p>
Employers cannot directly observe everything you learned.
They need signals.
A case study gives them something to inspect.
A measurable result gives them something to evaluate.
</p>

